WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
We didn't eat

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,360
Just sat on the edge and smelled it

3
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,320
Not even smelling

4
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,520
This pot of oil and gas

5
