I also spent money to buy and smell it.

6
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,660
Even if you steal this

7
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:17,940
Smell it is also called secretly calling to accompany me. Boss, I was the one who caused the head attack and punished me by sitting down.

8
